{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11642","headline":"咏怀古迹五首 四 · 杜甫","name":"咏怀古迹五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀主窥吴幸三峡，崩年亦在永安宫。\n翠华想像空山里，玉殿虚无野寺中。\n古庙杉松巢水鹤，岁时伏腊走村翁。\n武侯祠屋常邻近，一体君臣祭祀同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","citation":"萧涤非"}